OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy rain
OL,6,Fand gales for Orkney at first, soon
OL,7,Fclearing northeast but spreading to
OL,8,FShetland and persisting there until
OL,9,Fshortly after midnight. Frequent
OL,10,Fshowers follow overnight but winds
OL,11,Fwill ease.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FFrequent showers for Shetland
OL,14,Fthrough the day, turning to more
OL,15,Fpersistent rain for Orkney in the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Windy with severe gales
OL,17,Fdeveloping for Orkney through the
OL,18,Fafternoon into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
