OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FFrequent showers clear and the wind
OL,7,Feases down Monday morning. Strong
OL,8,Fwinds, showery rain return from Monday
OL,9,Fnight and continue through Tuesday.
OL,10,FWinds easing through Wednesday with
OL,11,Fsunshine and showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
